The Instructions for gArI when behaviour cloning

when recording:
- hold sprint and tap W, click when off W = Sprint hit
- jump and hit = crit hit
- maybe if feeling confident, add in strafing (pressing A & D) to dodge hits
- the difficulty of the bot (from the map) use what ever setting that you are confident that you will win
against. Test it out before recording for gArI
- for the aim start you crosshair on an angle so gArI can notice that you are using your mouse

The map will be theobaldthebirds practice map, its in the git just look for the map folder.
To get the map working you need a mod called Herobot installed on your inststance.
There will also be a texture pack for the targetting.
